\id DEU  
\h Deuteronomy 
\toc1 DEUTERONOMY 
\toc2 Deuteronomy 
\toc3 DEU 
\mt1 DEUTERONOMY  
\c 5  
\p
\v 16  \x + \xo 5:16 \xt Matt 15:4; Eph 6:1 \x* Honor your father and your mother, as the Lord your God commanded you; that it may be well with you, and that you may live long upon the land, which the Lord your God gives you.  
\v 17 You shall not commit murder.  
\v 18 You shall not commit adultery.  
\v 19 You shall not steal.  
\v 20 You shall not bear false witness against your neighbor.  
